{#
  One quadlet container unit, rendered by loom.

  The repository's own fields come first, in the order the unit source wrote
  them, and every field guarden owns follows in a fixed order. There is no
  [Install] table: quadlet generates it, and a unit that carries one is a unit
  quadlet refuses.
#}
